# Minimal NaniteBuilder PBRT v4 test scene
Film "rgb" "integer xresolution" [64] "integer yresolution" [64]
Sampler "halton" "integer pixelsamples" [1]
Integrator "path"
Camera "perspective" "float fov" [45]

WorldBegin

MakeNamedMaterial "white"
    "string type" "diffuse"
    "rgb reflectance" [0.8 0.8 0.8]

NamedMaterial "white"

Shape "plymesh" "string filename" ["cube.ply"]
